Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||09-05-2000||12:21 PM||||i was on a camaro BB (ls1.com) and the people there rant and rave about zaino car wax, and how well it works on GM paint. anyone have any experience with this wax? also, i have a customer at work who details cars professionally (in rancho santa fe and such, ferraris, lambos, porsches) and he told me about a wax for black cars called "green wax" anyone heard of that either? apparently green wax you use an orbital to apply, then just wipe it off, no elbow grease, and he said it looks great!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1012904&a=7460599&p=25516673"> ||||reg||1
