Z||000003||RossT||09-06-2000||02:08 AM||||I am a new Zaino user.  My freshly zainoed car pics are at:  <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003403.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003403.html</A> <P>The first application is rather a pain, but much easier thereafter.<P><BR>I will use nothing else from now on!! unless some TV comercial says they have the best stuff!!  lol...<P>honestly, it really is good stuff and well worth it.<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 09-06-2000).]||||reg||1
